From aa6e242f8766b8975bc9a594f9a8ab1e584c2763 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:38:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] bdj: hold notifications until their picture is presented

BD-J notifications are raised when the player reads the data, ahead of
the picture on screen. Applications draw mark graphics, react to play
items and see the playlist end that much early. Media time runs from a
seek before the target is shown, and a playlist stopped while its last
clip is shown raises no BD_EVENT_PLAYLIST_STOP.
---
